  <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
    <name>CloudDirectory</name>
    <id>74</id>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
      <segments>Object.CloudDirectory</segments>
    </dataPath>
    <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>CloudDirectoryExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>76</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>For example, &quot;exchange&quot;. The directory must exist in the service. Only Latin letters are allowed.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>برای مثال، &quot;exchange&quot;. پوشه باید در سرویس وجود داشته باشد. فقط حروف لاتین مجاز است.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Например 'exchange’. Каталог должен быть уже создан в сервисе. Допустимо использовать только латинские символы </value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Örnek olarak &quot;exchange&quot;. Katalog, önceden hizmette oluşturulmuş olmalıdır. Sadece Latin karakterlerinin kullanılmasına izin verilmektedir</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Ví dụ 'exchange’. Thư mục cần được tạo trong dịch vụ. Cho phép sử dụng chỉ các ký tự latinh </value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>For example, &quot;exchange&quot;. The directory must exist in the service. Only Latin letters are allowed.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>For example, &quot;exchange&quot;. The directory must exist in the service. Only Latin letters are allowed.</value>
      </title>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>CloudDirectoryContextMenu</name>
      <id>75</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <type>InputField</type>
    <editMode>Enter</editMode>
    <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
    <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
    <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
